+External whole-turn engines use `agent.externalTurns` to persist `turn/owner` before effects and explicitly resume the same open turn; versioned idle admission also lets a trusted Host start a turn without synthetic user input; ordinary turns and forks retain their repair. [Agent-loop](../packages/core/agent-loop/README.md#understand-the-implementation) defines ownership, durability and failure handling.
 
